# Calculator

This is my Calculator project developed as **Level 1 - Task 3** for the **CodSoft Web Development Internship**.
The project is built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript** with a simple and responsive user interface.
It performs basic arithmetic operations such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division.
This project helped me strengthen my JavaScript, DOM manipulation, and front-end development skills.
Thank you for visiting my repository!